                                    <h2>Electro-Voice PL-DK7</h2>
                    
                    <h2 class="sub">                    7-Mic Set</h2>
                    <p>The PL-DK7 bundles 7 of Electro-Voice&#8217;s popular PL-series performance microphones into a kit suitable for drum miking. It includes:</p><ul><li>One PL 33 (with hard mount) for kick drum</li><li>Four PL 35 (with hard mount and rim clamp) for snare and toms</li><li>Two PL 37 condensers (with hard mounts) for overheads</li></ul><p>The microphones are packed into a padded &#8220;gig bag,&#8221; which appears to be a rigid plastic case covered in woven black Nylon, with a shoulder strap. The case has foam cutouts to accommodate two additional PL35s and one additional PL37.<p>Permalink: <a href="//recordinghacks.com/microphones/Electro-Voice/PL-DK7">Electro-Voice PL-DK7</a></p>                    
